Copyright (c) 2026 zwhzss. All rights reserved except as stated here. This is not an
open-source license.

Free of charge for **personal study and education only**: you may copy, read, build, run and
modify the software locally for learning, teaching demonstrations or academic research, and
may redistribute copies provided this notice and the copyright line are kept intact.

**Any commercial use requires prior written permission from the author** — including selling,
subscription or paid distribution; running it as a SaaS, hosted or production service;
bundling it into a commercial product or service; and using it for monetized content
aggregation, scraping or redistribution.

The software is designed to run on a single local machine and to collect only publicly
available factual news. Do not use it to bypass robots.txt or technical protection measures,
or to send high-frequency requests to third-party servers. The software is provided "as is",
without warranty of any kind, and the author is not liable for any resulting damages.

